<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαπο-δείκνῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prove, demonstrate besides</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τ&lt;&gt;νων τὸν λόγον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				321.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					77c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.998c
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>appoint besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαποδειχθῆναι πρὸς ταῖς νῦν
					ὑπαρχούσαις τέσσαρσι φυλαῖς . . καὶ ἄλλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					56.23
				</span></i>
			 (Canopus, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ
				-δειχθέντος [γραμματέως</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
				42.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν συνάρξοντα αὐτῷ προσαποδειχθῆναι
					ἔδει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					54.10
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνναος τῷ Διὶ προσαπεδείχθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					7.7.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
